WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.080
A locked red room.

2
00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.550
A ten-year-old girl on a stool.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.350
Her aunt opens the door
only to snap: "Silence!"

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.590
Earlier, the boy of the
house called her "rat".

5
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.790
Years later, a poor, plain governess
faces her master in a moonlit orchard and

6
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.130
asks: "Do you think I am an automaton?"

7
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.930
Poor, plain, little.

8
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.680
So why can nobody keep her quiet?

9
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.750
In this mission, you'll hear
ten-year-old Jane turn on her aunt:

10
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:30.970
"How dare I, Mrs.

11
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:31.530
Reed?

12
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.090
How dare I?"

13
00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:36.310
You'll meet the household
ranged against her at Gateshead.

14
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.400
And you'll take apart her orchard speech,

15
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.450
question by question.

16
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.820
Your mission: explain why
Jane is so hard to silence.
